## Phase 5 — Redis and BullMQ / 2026-08-30 / Commit: c1596f4 ("phase 5: queues")

### Built

Schema — `prisma/schema.prisma` + migration
`20260829185601_phase5_job_processing_log`:
- `JobProcessingLog` — `@@unique([queue, idempotencyKey])`. The database
  constraint every processor's idempotency actually rests on.

Queue infrastructure — `src/queues/`:
- `connection.ts` — `sharedQueueConnection` (one, shared by every `Queue`),
  `createWorkerConnection(name)` (one per `Worker`, never shared). Both tuned
  with `maxRetriesPerRequest: null`, which BullMQ requires and
  `src/infra/redis.ts`'s fail-fast health-check connection cannot offer.
- `names.ts` — `QUEUE_NAMES` (`solver`, `offer-expiry`, `notification`,
  `cleanup`), `DEAD_LETTER_QUEUE_NAME`.
- `backoff.ts` — `cappedExponentialBackoff` (base 1s, cap 5min),
  `RETRY_JOB_OPTIONS` (`attempts: 5`).
- `idempotent.ts` — `runIdempotently(queue, key, effect, db?)`. Inserts the
  `job_processing_log` row and runs `effect` in the SAME Postgres transaction;
  a `P2002` on the insert means the key was already processed and `effect`
  never ran.
- `debounce.ts` — `enqueueDebounced(queue, name, dedupeKey, data, windowMs)`,
  built on BullMQ's `deduplication` + `delay`.
- `queues.ts` — `queues: Record<QueueName, Queue>`, `deadLetterQueue`, both
  constructed once with `defaultJobOptions: RETRY_JOB_OPTIONS`.
- `deadLetter.ts` — `moveToDeadLetterIfTerminal(queueName, job, error)`,
  wired to every Worker's `failed` event; only acts when
  `attemptsMade >= attempts`.
- `board.ts` — `createQueueAdminRouter()`, `BULL_BOARD_PATH` (`/admin/queues`).

Processors — `src/workers/`:
- `cleanup.ts` — REAL work: `sweepExpiredIdempotencyKeys`,
  `releaseExpiredHolds` (conditional `updateMany` on
  `status='ACTIVE' AND expiresAt < now()`, same shape as `assignUnit.ts`'s
  claim). `scheduleCleanup` registers a 5-minute repeatable job via
  `Queue.upsertJobScheduler`.
- `solver.ts`, `notification.ts`, `offerExpiry.ts` — plumbing only.
  `enqueueSolve`, `enqueueNotification`, `scheduleOfferExpiry` exported for
  Phases 6-9/15b/12 to call; nothing calls them yet.
- `runWorkers.ts` — `startWorkers()`/`stopWorkers()`, one `Worker` per queue
  name, `settings.backoffStrategy: cappedExponentialBackoff`, dead-letter
  wired on `failed`.

Realtime cross-process delivery:
- `src/realtime/redisConnection.ts` — `createRealtimeRedisConnection`, a
  third connection family (pub/sub only, never shared with BullMQ or health).
- `src/realtime/server.ts` — `io.adapter(createAdapter(pubClient, subClient))`
  from `@socket.io/redis-adapter`; `closeRealtimeAdapter()` for shutdown.
- `src/realtime/publish.ts` — `Emittable` interface unifies a real `Server`
  and a `@socket.io/redis-emitter` `Emitter`; `setRealtimeServer` widened to
  accept either; a lazily-built fallback `Emitter` is used whenever `server`
