  caught and logged rather than thrown.

Process wiring:
- `src/worker.ts` — rewritten: `startWorkers()` at boot, `stopWorkers()`
  (graceful — `Worker.close()` waits for the in-flight job) on
  SIGINT/SIGTERM, 10s force-exit backstop matching `src/index.ts`.
- `src/index.ts` — shutdown also calls `closeRealtimeAdapter()`.
- `src/auth/permissions.ts` — `queueAdmin` resource, `DISPATCHER`-only.
- `src/api/app.ts` — mounts Bull Board at `BULL_BOARD_PATH` behind
